  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell imbues a single creature with great bravery and morale in battle. The target gains a +2 morale bonus on attack rolls, saves, and skill checks.Mythic HeroismSource Mythic Adventures pg. 98\nThe morale bonus increases to +4 and applies on all checks, attack rolls, saves, and weapon damage rolls. Allies adjacent to the target gain a +4 morale bonus on saves against fear effects.\n\nAugmented (3rd): If you expend two uses of mythic power, the target can attempt one additional attack per round when taking a full attack action (as if using a haste spell). The target can use this additional attack ability a number of times equal to your tier.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell imbues a single creature with great bravery and morale in battle. the target gains a +2 morale bonus on attack rolls, saves, and skill checks.mythic heroismsource mythic adventures pg. 98\\nthe morale bonus increases to +4 and applies on all checks, attack rolls, saves, and weapon damage rolls. allies adjacent to the target gain a +4 morale bonus on saves against fear effects.\\n\\naugmented (3rd): if you expend two uses of mythic power, the target can attempt one additional attack per round when taking a full attack action (as if using a haste spell). the target can use this additional attack ability a number of times equal to your tier.\"",
    "sections": []
  },
